      "text": {
        "jp": "え？　いや、消えてないぞ。\r\nなんでも、今度は雄叫びから\r\nいびきのような音に変わったらしい。",
        "official_en": "What? No, no—the sound has apparently changed to some kind of snore.",
        "real_en": "Huh? No, it hasn't stopped. Apparently, the sound has changed from a roar to something like snoring."
      },
