        "official_en_sha256": "95230cb7e1a55db61b9c0aabce6843237b9dcc130bfd7c5c538907ed9907f4e1"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "となると、新種の生命体か……はたまた、幻獣か。\r\nただ、調査しようにも、普通にいける場所でもないしなぁ。",
        "official_en": "Which means it might be some sort of new lifeform, or maybe even an esper. We’d go to investigate, but it’s no place for any sane person...",
        "real_en": "Then maybe it's a new kind of life-form... or an Eidolon. But it's not exactly somewhere we can just go investigate."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
