        "official_en_sha256": "d1c6eb2d372ea8e11b828b684b510d4401d8b3320a561249292dcf5b0fe1b86a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "まるで何かの雄叫びのようだと聞いたが……\r\n火山の中に生き物がいるわけがない。",
        "official_en": "Bouts of ferocious roars, apparently. Can’t imagine that being possible, though—nothing would survive in a volcano.",
        "real_en": "They say it sounds like something roaring... But there's no way anything could be alive inside a volcano."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
