        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon630_Ifrit_01:Summon630_Ifrit_01_004:8d944863",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_Summon630_Ifrit_01:Summon630_Ifrit_01_004:8d944863",
        "jp_sha256": "6c8341cf0f45f04167c21f0058187929a328619bc9ee01c0052b35606bb440b6",
        "official_en_sha256": "e411b1215e137dd97ae90894b3562ea73b0624acb3d3c1a0b92715afc2ff4667"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "飛空艇で火口に降りればいけるんだろうが……\r\nそんなバカなヤツいないだろ？\r\n飛んで火に入る鉄の船ってか。",
        "official_en": "You <text style=\"italic\">can</> get in there with an airship, but who’d be that mad? It’s bad enough that you’re flying above molten lava—you’ll just end up out of the flying can, and into fiery death.",
        "real_en": "We could probably get there by descending into the crater in an airship... But who'd be stupid enough to try? Talk about a flying iron ship heading straight into the fire."
      },
